# This is a file of tests for the GMOS sequencer in a suitable format to be read
# by the tcsTests.tk procedure.
# 
# This particular test file is aimed at checking that CAD
# commands are rejected or accepted as specified whilst observing.
#
#
# Comments are introduced by a # in the first column
# Blank lines can be left if required.
# The currently allowed keywords are (case is immaterial)
#
#  Test   <testId>
#  Command <commandName>
#  Field   <CAD field> <value>
#  Response Accept | Reject
#  Timeout <msecs>
#  OnError Continue | Abort
#  Log     <recordName>
#  Directive Start | Preset

# This first part before the first Test keyword can be used to setup 
# global values for Response, TimeOut and OnError. These global values
# can be over ridden within specific tests

Response Reject
TimeOut  5000
OnError  Continue

Help
Help This set of test is aimed at checking that CAD
Help commands are rejected or accepted as specified whilst observing.
Help
Help The first test starts an observation using the 'observe' CAD
Help Then all GMOS Sequencer CADs are tested to see whether they
Help are accepted or rejected as specified.
Help Press continue when ready
Help

# Tests start here. Each test must start with the Test keyword, end with
# a Directive keyword and have at least one Command keyword. Any Field
# keywords are assumed to apply to the last command

Test UT07010
Summary Send 'observe' command
Help Send 'observe' command

TimeOut  2000

 Command   observe
 Field  DIR MARK 
 Response  Accept 
 Directive Start

Test UT07020
Summary Check acceptance of abort command whilst observing
Help Check acceptance of abort command whilst observing

TimeOut  5000

 Command abort
 Response  Accept 
 Directive Start

Test UT07030
Summary Check acceptance of continue command whilst observing
Help Check acceptance of continue command whilst observing

 Command continue
 Response  Accept 
 Directive Start

Test UT07040
Summary Check acceptance of debug command whilst observing
Help Check acceptance of debug command whilst observing

 Command   debug
 Response  Accept 
 Directive Start

Test UT07050
Summary Check acceptance of endGuide command whilst observing
Help Check acceptance of endGuide command whilst observing

 Command   endGuide
 Response  Accept 
 Directive Start

Test UT07060
Summary Check acceptance of endObserve command whilst observing
Help Check acceptance of endObserve command whilst observing

 Command   endObserve
 Response  Accept 
 Directive Start

Test UT07070
Summary Check acceptance of endVerify command whilst observing
Help Check acceptance of endVerify command whilst observing

 Command   endVerify
 Response  Accept 
 Directive Start

Test UT07080
Summary Check acceptance of guide command whilst observing
Help Check acceptance of guide command whilst observing
  
 Command   guide 
 Response  Accept 
 Directive Start

Test UT07085
Summary Check acceptance of verify command whilst observing
Help Check acceptance of verify command whilst observing
  
 Command   verify 
 Response  Accept 
 Directive Start

Test UT07090
Summary Check acceptance of pause command whilst observing
Help Check acceptance of pause command whilst observing

 Command   pause
 Response  Accept 
 Directive Start

Test UT07100
Summary Re-send 'observe' command after pause
Help Re-send 'observe' command after pause

 Command   observe   
 Response  Accept 
 Directive Start

Test UT07110
Summary Check acceptance of stop command whilst observing
Help Check acceptance of stop command whilst observing

 Command   stop
 Response  Accept 
 Directive Start
